"passage: # CareNote is live! / CareNote в сторах!\n\n2025-05-30 · email\n\nMarina, Gleb, team,\n\nCareNote is officially live in the App Store and Google Play as of this morning! Huge thanks to everyone at Severny Veter — Timur, Kate, Pavel, and of course Nastya, who I hope is resting.\n\nThe pilot starts on Monday with 12 NHS hospitals, mostly in the North West. Ward managers got their onboarding packs this week. We expect around 900 nurses in the first month.\n\nLet's have a short retro next week and plan the analytics dashboard. Drinks are on me when you're next in London.\n\nPriya\n"
