"passage: # Dockside v2 — Antwerp / Dockside v2 — Антверпен\n\n2026-11-02 · email\n\nHi Marina,\n\nlong time! Hope Belgrade is treating you and the family well.\n\nSome news: Harbor Freight Labs has just signed a deal with the Port of Antwerp, and we want to do Dockside v2 there — 5 terminals in the first phase. Rotterdam has been running on your system without major issues since the 2023 launch, so the board wants the same team.\n\nMain changes vs v1: multi-port setup, real-time customs status, and a new mobile app for crane operators. Timeline: start in Q1 2027.\n\nCould you and Gleb join a call next week? I'll send an RFP draft before that.\n\nCheers,\nJames\n"
